{"id":"wb-1-59","name":"安平桥（五里桥）","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"安平桥","text":"安平桥，又称五里桥和西桥，位于中国福建省泉州市，是横跨晋江市安海镇和南安市水头镇之间的海面上的一座中式古代长桥，桥上刻着“天下无桥长此桥”的对联，为中国古代第一长桥。据记载，此桥共长八百一十一丈，阔十六尺（也有说一丈四尺的）。明末名将郑芝龙、郑成功父子故乡即在此桥附近，现存的安平桥，实际共长2070米（约合中国古代里程五里，故亦称五里桥），桥宽3至3.8米，为国家重点文物保护单位、国家4A级景区。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%89%E5%B9%B3%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":95155837,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95155837","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/194cad40068c2fc3e7c795b9.jpg","title":"安平桥公园.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%AE%89%E5%B9%B3%E6%A1%A5%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8f/%E5%AE%89%E5%B9%B3%E6%A1%A5%E5%85%AC%E5%9B%AD.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Alexbear","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​自己作品","width":320,"height":427}}